; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Core.c	  2664   \DESCRIPTION    Os_Hal_ContextInit is called with a pointer to the local variable and pointer to a Context object
; ..\BSW\Os\Os_Core.c	  2665                   derived from an argument of the caller function. The correctness of the caller argument is ensured by
